Output cli-recipe.mp4
Output cli-recipe.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1280
Set Height 820
Set Padding 28
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Hide
Type "export POSSIBLE_TELEMETRY=0 PS1='$ ' && clear"
Enter
Show
Sleep 700ms
Type `possible search "teach a robot duck a dance" | head -5`
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 3500ms
Type "possible fetch kh79hk92ss2q5d96kb9f6h0aan8dnzdt | grep -v '^Purpose' | sed 's/ — http.*//' | head -20"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 8000ms
